{"id": "sci-8-l44", "grade": 8, "subject": "sci", "stage": "prep-7-9", "lang": "ar", "title": "الأسموزية في الخلايا الحية", "titleAr": "العلوم — الصف الثامن", "steps": [{"title": "اقرأ", "eyebrow": "الخطوة ١ — اقرأ", "heading": "الأسموزية في الخلايا الحية", "blocks": [{"type": "panel", "anim": "osmosis", "title": "🎬 شاهد", "html": "<div class=\"anim\" style=\"max-width:460px;margin:0 auto\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"الأسموزية: يعبر الماء الغشاء من المخفف إلى المركّز\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:16px;background:#fafafa\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><style>@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important}}</style><rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#e1f5fe\" stroke=\"#0288d1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"190\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"190\" y2=\"270\" stroke=\"#6d4c41\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 5\"/><text x=\"115\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\">ماء أكثر (محلول مخفف)</text><text x=\"265\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\">سكر أكثر (مركّز)</text><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"110\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"255\" cy=\"110\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"290\" cy=\"110\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"155\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"255\" cy=\"155\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"290\" cy=\"155\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"200\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"255\" cy=\"200\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"290\" cy=\"200\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"220\" cy=\"245\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"255\" cy=\"245\"/><circle r=\"9\" fill=\"#ffb300\" cx=\"290\" cy=\"245\"/><circle r=\"5\" fill=\"#29b6f6\"><animate attributeName=\"cx\" values=\"80;230\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/><animate attributeName=\"cy\" values=\"100;105\" dur=\"3s\" begin=\"0.0s\" repeatCou